{"unit_id":"taxueseek__plugin-fast-adapt#card-zh","repo":"taxueseek/plugin-fast-adapt","commit":"a60d9a2a5d17838f7d7b80802e812fc2ca45dbd7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-fast-adapt 是一款面向 DSH 插件开发者的升级适配与诊断工具，可作为命令行技能使用，也能挂载到 Web 或桌面端 DSH。它通过原生 Cordis 服务、Agent 工具和斜杠命令提供插件审计、环境体检、内存冒烟及插件集群巡检；配套工作流还能扫描官方升级指南并生成五种形态的插件脚手架。适合维护 DSH 插件、排查宿主升级后兼容问题或批量盘点插件的开发者。需要 Node.js 22.13 或更高版本，不需要额外 API 密钥；获取上游版本和指南时会访问 npm registry 与 GitHub。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:35","lib/index.js:48","scripts/code-scan.mjs:1","scripts/scaffold.mjs:1"]}
{"unit_id":"taxueseek__plugin-fast-adapt#card-en","repo":"taxueseek/plugin-fast-adapt","commit":"a60d9a2a5d17838f7d7b80802e812fc2ca45dbd7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"plugin-fast-adapt helps DSH developers handle plugin upgrades. Its CLI and native service scan compatibility, inspect environments, run smoke checks, and report plugin fleets. Scripts scaffold five forms. Requires Node.js 22.13+, no API key; guide data uses npm and GitHub.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:35","lib/index.js:48","scripts/code-scan.mjs:1","scripts/scaffold.mjs:1"]}
