{"unit_id":"taxueseek__plugin-fast-adapt#feature-1","repo":"taxueseek/plugin-fast-adapt","commit":"a60d9a2a5d17838f7d7b80802e812fc2ca45dbd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-fast-adapt 的功能「升级变更扫描」：读取官方升级指南中的包名、成员和常量锚点，扫描插件源码并列出命中位置与修复动作。通过适配工作流触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/code-scan.mjs:1"]}
{"unit_id":"taxueseek__plugin-fast-adapt#feature-2","repo":"taxueseek/plugin-fast-adapt","commit":"a60d9a2a5d17838f7d7b80802e812fc2ca45dbd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-fast-adapt 的功能「插件审计」：分析插件的性能、依赖弹性、工具上下文预算和生命周期等维度，生成分项评分与问题报告。可从原生服务或审计命令调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/plugin-audit.mjs:151","lib/index.js:37"]}
{"unit_id":"taxueseek__plugin-fast-adapt#feature-3","repo":"taxueseek/plugin-fast-adapt","commit":"a60d9a2a5d17838f7d7b80802e812fc2ca45dbd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-fast-adapt 的功能「宿主环境诊断」：探测 DSH 安装版本、profile 覆盖层和已安装插件状态，输出环境诊断信息。可通过原生服务或诊断工作流使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/env-doctor.mjs:1","lib/index.js:38"]}
{"unit_id":"taxueseek__plugin-fast-adapt#feature-4","repo":"taxueseek/plugin-fast-adapt","commit":"a60d9a2a5d17838f7d7b80802e812fc2ca45dbd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-fast-adapt 的功能「插件脚手架」：按 tool、hook、service、config 或 llm-adapter 形态生成插件文件与命名，并提供相应验证流程。通过脚手架命令创建新项目。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/scaffold.mjs:1"]}
{"unit_id":"taxueseek__plugin-fast-adapt#feature-5","repo":"taxueseek/plugin-fast-adapt","commit":"a60d9a2a5d17838f7d7b80802e812fc2ca45dbd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-fast-adapt 的功能「集群巡检」：发现工作区插件或本机已安装插件，按客户端和运行状态分类，生成结构化巡检报告。通过 fleet-sweep 工作流触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/fleet-sweep.mjs:1","scripts/fleet-sweep.mjs:123"]}
